# Shared model of acoustics/ (INCLUDEd): a steel plate of 4 x 4 CQUAD4,
# 200 x 200 x 1 mm at z = 0, clamped on its edges (SPC set 1) and loaded
# at (50, 50) (load set 1), under an air cavity of 4 x 4 x 2 CHEXA on
# PSOLID PFLUID (MAT10 2, GE .01), x and y 0 to 200, z 10 to 110. The
# 10 mm gap between the plate and the cavity floor is filled by each deck
# (acoustic absorber and barrier elements, or a trim component). Units: mm,
# N, t, s.
#
